    ; container to its subtree needs a real intrinsic pass. This IS that pass.
    ; It was written when the alternative was reporting a made-up number; the
    ; alternative now is every component hand-setting a width its own children
    ; already know, which is worse and does not stay correct.
    ; nothing in it to be wide: no text, picture or source, and only boxes
    ; like it with no width of their own
