        ; the span this element occupies, so a nested card's columns line up with
        ; every other card's instead of each one splitting its own width. The
        ; parent filled these in before laying this element out; with no
        ; enclosing grid there is nothing to inherit and it falls back to 1fr.
        if (colSpec == "subgrid") {
